function v5LangPick(){const L=v5Lang()||'pt';return `<div class="v5lang v5noi18n">${[['pt','Português'],['en','English'],['es','Español']].map(([k,n])=>`<button class="${L===k?'on':''}" onclick="v5SetLang('${k}')" aria-pressed="${L===k}">${n}</button>`).join('')}</div>${L!=='pt'?`<div class="xs mut v5noi18n" style="margin-top:4px">${L==='en'?'Beta: menus, buttons and guides are translated. News, interviews and events are still in Portuguese.':'Beta: menús, botones y guías están traducidos. Noticias, entrevistas y eventos siguen en portugués.'}</div>`:''}`}
